        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-03T16:39:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmmm, this seems an interesting idea. Perhaps a bit too clever. I had thought about retrying the allocation later and remapping the bitmap with an in-oder traversal. I abandoned this because it seemed too complex. Let me think.\n\nI lean towards a simpler approach, after all disabling the bitmap will be unlikely and it doesn\u0027t cause any regressions from the current performance.",
      "parentUuid": "cb6f8f12_bff6a408",
      "revId": "aee6241db2502fdc29401c871476155b4cd683d2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
